  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: Add macOS support (smbclient), WSL smbclient support on Windows (opt-in), and sample console app. macOS is treated like Linux when smbclient is available. On Windows, set UseWsl=true to use smbclient via WSL instead of native UNC paths. Includes interactive SmbSharp.Sample project for testing.",
